   by fitting the key plan to OpenStreetMap's roads. Everything below is a real-world figure,
   in metres, km/h and g. Two things are exaggerated on purpose, and each is a single number:

     tc    time compression. The scene runs this many times faster than life, so a lap that
           takes the same time on screen at the default 1×. The control offers 0.25× to 2×.
     exag  the car is drawn this many times life size, so it still reads from the wide shot.
