     says of itself "not a survey, not to scale": it is a schematic in the sheet's bottom margin drawn with a fat
     stroke so it reads at thumbnail size. Scaled until the lap is its true 2,910 m, the stroke became a 35 m
     road, and a 5 m car standing on a 35 m road looks like a toy. pipeline/gc3d/measure_road_width.py measures
